  - id: under_the_green_tree
    displayName: Under the Green Tree
    flavorText: Israel burns incense to Baal under green trees on the hills, crediting
      him for the corn, wine, and oil the LORD himself supplied.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Frames Israel's idolatry as marital infidelity, as Israel credits Baal
      for provisions the LORD actually gave and pursues him under shady trees, requiring
      Israel to be stripped bare and led back into the wilderness to be won again.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: baal_worship
