  - id: the_molten_calves
    displayName: The Molten Calves
    flavorText: Samaria bows to a molten calf fashioned by human hands, an idol the
      LORD declares will be broken to pieces and carried off to Assyria.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Condemns Israel's self-manufactured golden-calf worship at Bethel and
      Dan as a homegrown, manmade substitute for the LORD, doomed to be smashed to
      pieces and carried off as tribute to Assyria.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: calf_worship
