  - id: dew_and_lily
    displayName: Dew and Lily
    flavorText: Hosea calls Israel to return to the LORD with words instead of sacrifices,
      promising to heal their backsliding and love them freely.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Invites Israel to abandon idols and return to the LORD in genuine repentance,
      promising healing, free love, and flourishing restoration as the book's closing
      resolution to the marriage/harlotry metaphor.
